<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>Croatian indoor men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Alex Radulescu (Romania) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>4-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat 7-David Prinosil (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat 3-Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>5-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5.</p>
</text>
